arzissenkreuz?","nextNodeIds":[741650105]},{"nodeId":741650105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21262,"speakerName":"Narzissenkreuz","textMapHash":3102313194,"text":"If you have heard my name, then you know of my quest to save the world, and there is a chance that you can be saved.","nextNodeIds":[741650106]},{"nodeId":741650106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21262,"speakerName":"Narzissenkreuz","textMapHash":1679108162,"text":"You draw your weapons at me only because you have been misled by untruths. But this is no time for me to waste my powers.","nextNodeIds":[741650107]},{"nodeId":741650107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21262,"speakerName":"Narzissenkreuz","textMapHash":3579205450,"text":"Wonder and rejoice. When all is over, I shall explain, I shall demonstrate. But now, place the Holy Blade in my hand and flee to safety.","nextNodeIds":[741650108]},{"nodeId":741650108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3049470650,"text":"We're not giving you the Holy Blade.","nextNodeIds":[741650109]},{"nodeId":741650109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21262,"speakerName":"Narzissenkreuz","textMapHash":541511594,"text":"Foolish, foolish. But I forgive you and will save you nevertheless.","nextNodeIds":[741650110]},{"nodeId":741650110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21262,"speakerName":"Narzissenkreuz","textMapHash":3175185818,"text":"I can sense that the four orthants have been reversed. But the tree of flowing is not yet complete.","nextNodeIds":[741650111]},{"nodeId":741650111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21262,"speakerName":"Narzissenkreuz","textMapHash":3934026538,"text":"It is no longer possible to save everyone. I will extend my benevolence as far as possible, even if it makes an overdraft of my own life force.","nextNodeIds":[741650112]},{"nodeId":741650112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21262,"speakerName":"Narzissenkreuz","textMapHash":3426578106,"text":"If only five in ten can be saved, I will strive to save six in ten.","nextNodeIds":[741650113]},{"nodeId":741650113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21262,"speakerName":"Narzissenkreuz","textMapHash":2639252634,"text":"Now, I shall come to take the Holy Blade.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7416501,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["[3_7252:2560.706,-76.100,3379.072]","20"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"}}},{"subQuestId":7416504,"order":66,"stepDescription":"Defeat Narzissenkreuz","stepDescTextMapHash":602607692,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"7416504_FINISH"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[],"talks":[],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"7416504_FINISH"}],"triggerCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_TEAM_DEAD","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_ANY_MANUAL_TRANSPORT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{